      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mfenced><mi>III</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mfenced><mi>IV</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfenced></math>",
